title: 'pallet-psm: emergency admin can only raise the circuit breaker'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: "Give `CircuitBreakerLevel` an ordering (`AllEnabled < MintingDisabled\
    \ < AllDisabled`). `set_asset_status` now rejects, for Emergency callers, any\
    \ move to a less restrictive level with `InsufficientPrivilege`. Keeping or raising\
    \ the level stays allowed. Lowering the level requires the full admin.\r\n"
crates:
- name: pallet-psm
  bump: minor
